<title>HUNGARY: Hungary BSE suspends Fotex for rest of day.</title>
<headline>Hungary BSE suspends Fotex for rest of day.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange suspended trading in shares of retailer Fotex Rt for the rest of Friday's session due to an excessive rise, traders said.</p>
<p>Trading in Fotex shares was suspended when the paper traded at 220 forints, having risen more than 26 percent since Thursday's close of 174 forints, they said.  </p>
<p>&quot;The bourse suspended trading at 220 forints and will not allow further trading today,&quot; one trader told Reuters.</p>
<p>The stock exchange decides to suspend trading for a day in any paper if its price movement exceeds 20 percent in either direction.</p>
</text>
